sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (Sender)
    participant Mobile as Mobile App
    participant Gateway as Payment Gateway
    participant Fraud as Fraud Detection
    participant Workflow as Workflow Orchestrator
    participant TigerBeetle as TigerBeetle Ledger
    participant Settlement as Settlement Service
    participant Notify as Notification Service
    participant Recipient as User (Recipient)
    
    User->>Mobile: Initiate P2P Transfer
    Mobile->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/payments/initiate
    Gateway->>Fraud: Check Fraud Score
    Fraud-->>Gateway: Score: 0.15 (LOW RISK)
    Gateway->>Workflow: Start Payment Workflow
    Workflow->>TigerBeetle: Create Transfer
    TigerBeetle-->>Workflow: Transfer Created
    Workflow->>Settlement: Record for Settlement
    Settlement-->>Workflow: Recorded
    Workflow-->>Gateway: Payment Completed
    Gateway->>Notify: Send Notifications
    Notify->>User: SMS: Payment Sent
    Notify->>Recipient: SMS: Payment Received
    Gateway-->>Mobile: Success Response
    Mobile-->>User: Show Confirmation
